window.products.push({"id":1084087,"name":"LoveInLunchBox pyrex glass storage containers with lids meal prep Food Storage Stain and odor resistant Easily stackable BPA-free for Oven microwave a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JeLvQRLPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you thinking it may be time to ditch the plastic and upgrade to glass storage containers? While plastic containers may be convenient, they aren’t always the best choice. Unlike plastic, certain glass containers can go from freezer to microwave or oven to table, for example. But making the switch to glass containers has benefits beyond versatility. Turning to glass has both environmental and health benefits. Glass containers minimize our exposure to harmful plasticizers like BPA and phthalates found in a lot of plastic containers. They're made of a nonporous surface—so they don't absorb smells or stains like your plastic containers. While the price might be higher than their plastic counterparts, containers made of glass last longer. Product Description： 4 PCS Lids & 4 PCS of 1040ml Rectangle GlassContainer Size: 20cm x 16cm x 6.5cm, Capacity: 860ml(29oz). Upgraded BPA-Free Snap Locking Lids with Silicone Seal Airtight, Leak Proof Freshness Lids Microwave, Oven, Freezer, Dishwasher SafeFood Containers，Stain and Odor Resistant Working temperature: Our containers withstand from -5℉ – 700℉ (-20℃ -400℃). Tips： 1. Lease take off the lids before placing in dishwasher, oven and microwave for better maintenance. 2. In order to prevent the rubber seal sticking to the glass containers, please must wash the lids and glass containers before put them away. 3. In order to make convenient to wash the lids, we design the rubber could take off from the lid easily, so if the rubber seal fall off, please install the rubber seal back to the original position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JeLvQRLPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N / A","source_asin":"B08HTQY6MM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HTQY6MM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HTQY6MM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
