window.products.push({"id":1084285,"name":"HomeTek Silicone Food Storage Bag (6 Bags) 2 New 10 oz Silicone Snack Bags, 2 Medium Reusable Sandwich Bags, 2 Large Reusable Silicone Food Bag, Extra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+kT7bSLgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to open the silicone bags? Hold the top left hand corner (where the hook is) with one hand, then slide the plastic closing rod from left to right (AWAY from where the triangle is pointing towards). The arrow is pointing towards the direction for they close in, not open. The plastic airtight sealing rod is meant to provide a hermetic effect so that the bags will be leak proof. In the beginning, it might be somewhat difficult to open as the bags are still very strong and sturdy, but this is completely normal. They will loosen up over time. You can also use a brush and put coconut oil in the slider to lubricate it and make it easier to open/close. How to clean the silicone bags? The simplest way is to turn the bags inside out, place them into the dishwasher and let it do the work for you. If you prefer washing by hand, turn the bag inside out, hand wash with soapy water + a sponge and air dry the bag over a glass or with the use of a towel. Dishwashers don’t always get the job done perfectly when the bag has stored oily or greasy food or liquids. We generally recommend hand washing in order to get them completely clean! Are the airtight sliders dishwasher safe? The sliders can withstand temperatures between  -76°F ~ 176°F (-60ºC ~ 80ºC). If the temperature of your dishwasher is between that range, then definitely!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+kT7bSLgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMETEK","source_asin":"B07Y5TGWQT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y5TGWQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y5TGWQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
