window.products.push({"id":1084295,"name":"HOFULK White 400ML Humidifiers for Bedroom USB Small Portable Quiet Cool Mist Humidifiers for Kids Cute Personal Auto Shut-off Air Humidifier for Plan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31puvJzj8cL._AC_.jpg","description":"Warm Tips.1.Please add tap water to top fill humidifiers(unscrew humidifier counterclockwise) ，don’t use essential oils, perfumes, distilled water, or pure water to avoid clogging the cotton swab；2. Please soak the cotton swab completely in water until softened before use;3. Please take care of spring in the cotton swab cannula; 4. Please don’t fill the water too full to avoid overflow(tighten humidifier clockwise, so no water leakage);5. Please keep the surface of the personal humidifier dry. Easy To Mini Humidifier. All functions of this small humidifier are controlled by one button, short press the button to turn on the spray of humidifiers for home, short press again to switch the spray mode, and the last short press to turn off the spray of room humidifier for bedroom. Long press to turn on the color-led night light and enter the gradient state, long press again to lock the light color at present, and the last long press to turn off the night light whole house humidifiers. Multifunctional Portable Humidifier. HOFULK air humidifier is 400ML, the size of a normal water cup, easy to carry, put in your bag, travel bag, or luggage, and perfect for bedroom, room, living room, home, plants, nursery, office, car, desk, and yoga. This will help increase air humidity, improve air quality, keep skin hydrated, breathe smoothly, and make people in good spirits. So it is perfect as a Thanksgiving, or Christmas gift for your family, friends, children, leaders, and colleagues. Super Quiet Night Light Humidifier. This LED light humidifier has a variety of colors and ultra-low volume, soft light is perfect for bedtime reading and storytelling to children. Charming and brilliant colors create a romantic and wonderful night. The volume of a quiet humidifier is less than 30 decibels so you can have quality sleep. the charging port on the back can be connected to a computer, power bank, and charger to supply power, convenient to place on the bedside or bedroom nightstand. Two Spray Modes & Waterless Auto Shut-off. The cool mist humidifier has two spray modes, continuous spraying for 4 hours and intermittent spraying for 8 hours. Once the water tank is short of water， it will automatically shut off, safe enough. Free your hands. In addition, there is a visualization of the water level window, easy for you to see the change in water volume, and grasp the time of use. In general, the water tank is filled with water and can be used continuously for more than 8 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31puvJzj8cL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOFULK","source_asin":"B0BJ2KH51J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ2KH51J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ2KH51J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
