window.products.push({"id":1084484,"name":"MEA Cama Twin XL Sheets Set - Super Soft Brushed Microfiber 3 Piece Twin Bed Sheets Sets - Luxury Style - Fade and Shrinkage Resistant – Deep Pockets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K1xQCPEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's in the box: 3 Piece Twin XL Sheets Set comprising of 1 fitted sheet (39”X80”), 1 flat sheet (66”X102”) and 1 standard size pillowcase (20”X30”). Why you should buy it: These Deep Pocket Twin XL Sheets are supersoft, skin friendly, durable, wrinkle, fade and shrinkage resistant, and easy to wash. Finest Quality Brushed Microfiber: Made of the best quality microfiber and designed in Portugal to give your bed room a luxurious look. Why it's a Great Gift: It's super soft, comfortable and luxurious look. Best for all kinds of room; bedroom, kids, room, vacation room, RV, guest room. Different from others: Our bed sheet set is specially designed and stitched so it can last longer, the 4 inch hem on top side of the flat sheet helps to retain the shape of sheet on the mattress and our deep pocket fitted sheet has the best quality elastic on all corners so it can fit your mattress up to 15 inch. A 4 inch envelop opening of the pillow covers helps you insert pillow fillings easily. Easy Care & Wash: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle, wash separately, Do not wash with cotton or terry sheets, wash using a mild detergent, Do not bleach, tumble dry low, remove promptly, dry on flat surface, do not dry clean or iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K1xQCPEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mea Cama Portugal","source_asin":"B08P8V7RHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P8V7RHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P8V7RHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
