window.products.push({"id":1084510,"name":"WOWKIA Removable Vinyl Record Storage Holder with Non-Slip Deep Groove Design- Store and Hold up to 60 Albums Display Stand - Solid Wood Base with Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711jUP3Q2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"(Tips: the protective film is to better protect the acrylic frame from damage, heat the protective paper with a hair dryer to make it easier to tear)NON-SLIP DEEP GROOVE DESIGN: This Vinyl Record Storage Holder adopts the minimalist design constructed of sustainable materials to realize the easy combination of card groove and support. The adjustable acrylic support can accurately match the three grooves on each base, allowing you to adjust the storage area as required, so as to always keep the LPS upright and prevent warpage and ring wear damage. LARGE CAPACITY AND SPACE SAVING: The size of this record holder is 11.85 x 11.26 x 1.85 inches. The vinyl record holder can hold 60 records. The open design makes it easy to find the records you need. At the same time, the records will be collected together to help you save more space. ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY AND DURABLE: Our vinyl record holder frame base is made of natural solid wood and durable top-grade acrylic. The wood strength is 3 times that of bamboo, which is firm and durable. It is environmentally friendly and pollution-free, can be used safely. EASY ASSEMBLY: DIY assembly is simple without screws. Vinyl Record Storage Holder parts can be easily made into joinery by sliding into the wooden notch, and the solid wood base is firmly supported without any external force. The perfect combination of all parts makes it the easiest record holder for albums furniture to assemble. MULTI FUNCTION STORAGE：This vinyl holder can not only create a beautiful area for music and passion, but also show your love for music and home decoration. It can also be used to store books, magazines and documents.(Tips: Heat the protective paper with a hair dryer to make it easier to tear)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711jUP3Q2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOWKIA","source_asin":"B099QV6CVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099QV6CVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099QV6CVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
