window.products.push({"id":1084523,"name":"Fittia Cooling Pillow Cases 2 Pack, Standard Size Q-Max 0.45 Cooling Pillowcases for Night Sweats & Hot Sleepers, Breathable Cool Summer Pillow Covers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C9CkClfTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄High-tech Cooling Pillowcase: Fittia cool pillowcase adopts unique technology, revolutionary adding nano-level jade factor to the fabric, making it into a natural cool material(Q-Max > 0.4). The cool pillow case will naturally absorb the heat and moisture discharged from the body and accelerate moisture evaporation, which is especially helpful for hot sleepers to fight night sweats and insomnia. ❄Anti-static & Elastic: Different from others, Fittia Cool Pillow Cover is unique in both sides cool fabric design, allowing you to embrace the coolness while sleeping. Cooling Fibers of cool pillowcases have natural antistatic properties that can help significantly reduce the \"bedhead\", and make your hair smoother and frizz-free when you wake up each morning. Cool pillowcase fabric is full of elasticity, you can put it on any shape pillow of similar size to enjoy cool sleep. ❄Silky Protection: The smooth surface of the cool pillowcase helps reduce facial wrinkles and protect skin health. The cooling pillowcases provide good breathability and moisture absorption, keeping skin fresh and avoiding night sweats. Silky cool pillow cases can reduce hair friction and avoid hair breakage caused by dry or knotted hair. ❄Hidden Zipper Design: The hidden zipper design of the cooling pillowcase ensure that the pillow fits into the pillowcase perfectly. The zipper of the pillowcase is durable and can be put on and taken off easily and smoothly. The zippered pillowcase can better present the shape of the pillowcase and decorate your bedroom. ❄Cool Bedding Choice: Each package includes 20\"x 26\" standard size cool pillowcases set of 2. You can gift your family or friends with this zippered cold pillowcase to enjoy an incredible cooling journey in the hot summer. Cooling pillow cases can be washed by hand or machine. Laundry bags are strongly recommended to prevent snagging and scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C9CkClfTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fittia","source_asin":"B099JMGRBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099JMGRBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099JMGRBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
