window.products.push({"id":1084907,"name":"CHACEEF Rice Cooker, 4-Cups Uncooked Small Rice Cooker, 2L Non-Stick Portable Rice Maker with 10 Cooking Functions, Digital Pannel Smart Control Cooke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511k+ORLeaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Digital Touch Control Panel】 With a multifunctional control panel, the Chaceef rice cooker provides 10 cooking functions to satisfy your daily needs, allowing you to easily unlock a variety of foods including white rice, brown rice, soups, porridge, cakes, and more. 【4-Cups Uncooked Capacity】 The CHACEEF 2.0L small rice cooker cooks up to 4 cups of raw white rice using a standard 160ml measuring cup, ideal for families with different eating habits. The portable size (8\" x 10\" x 10\") doesn't take up much space, making it convenient to store in the kitchen or take on RV travel. 【24-hour Timer Preset & 12H Keep Warm】 With a 1-24 hour delay start function, you can control the time more flexibly. Prepare your ingredients and presets before you go out and enjoy delicious rice when you get home. When cooking is complete, the rice maker will automatically enter the keep warm function. 【Healthy & Safe】 Materials that come into direct contact with food are free of BPA, PFAS, and PFOA, which are safer to use. With a removable non-stick inner pot and detachable inner lid, the cleaning is like a breeze. 【Make Rice Better】 With 6 cooking processes, the mini rice cooker can precisely control the cooking temperature, restoring the sweetness of the rice, and making the cooked rice taste better and more delicious. The first stage absorbs water at medium temperature, the second stage releases the original flavor, the third stage is heated with fierce fire, the fourth and fifth stages are boiled with high fire, and the final nutrition and heat preservation stage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511k+ORLeaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHACEEF","source_asin":"B0B1D5JHF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1D5JHF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1D5JHF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1084908,"name":"Comkit 7.5 Inch Long High Heel Shoe Shape Chocolate Mold, 3D Stereo Polycarbonate Chocolate Fondant Candy Cake Jelly Decorating Molding for DIY Home B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f-+KNaPGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"*This mold will help bring your cake decorating skills to a new level, enabling you to bring a professional quality to your work. *Great for making cake toppers and is a must have cake mold for kids ,lovers ,entertainment ,birthday ,or holiday gift. How to use: 1.The mold with hot water to wash clean, melting the chocolate. 2.After put the chocolate into the 1/3,shaking the mold to cover surface. 3.Chocolate sauce covering the surface of the mold. 4.Put in refrigerator. 5.After cooled, continue to add one layer chocolate sauce surface. 6.Gently tap, take off the clip, open the mold and remove the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f-+KNaPGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MoldFun","source_asin":"B07FZVNS6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FZVNS6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FZVNS6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1084909,"name":"Viking Professional 4 Slot Toaster, Stainless Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pR5a4Fz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Viking professional-grade, four-slice toaster offers restaurant quality toast at home. The toaster is insulated to internally retain heat and maximize toasting. Crafted from stainless steel, it has wide slots to accommodate bagels, Texas toast and pastries. Hydraulic engaging and lifting action levers are part of the toaster's package along with Viking's exclusive design and tooling. In front is a large, easy-to-use control knob with multiple timer settings that include Rewarm. You'll have easy access to the stainless steel crumb tray which removes for cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pR5a4Fz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Range","source_asin":"B001STGAF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001STGAF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001STGAF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1084910,"name":"puredown Goose Down Comforter King Size 800 Fill Power Ultra-Soft 100% Cotton Cover Luxury Cloud Fluffy Extra Warmth Duvet Insert or Stand-Alone Comfo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZO9oDm5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Fabric】- From the moment you glide your hand across the incredibly soft and breathable 100% cotton cover you will be smitten with the gorgeous quality of this goose down comforter. The cover is soothingly soft against your skin and encases sumptuously warm and soft. You will feel like sleeping on the clouds and noiseless when moving. 【High Down Content Filling】- This luxurious comforter is filled with 93% real goose down, genuine 800 high fill power, which is the biggest difference from other comforters. Our high quality goose down is ethically sourced and Responsible Down Standard (RDS), OEKO-Tex Standard 100 certified. Goose down generally comes in larger clusters than duck down, it can trap more air and provides more insulation, so is warmer and more robust. 【Extra Warmth Goose Down Comforter】 - King size: 104*88\", 43 oz. fill weight. There’s nothing like snuggling under this cozy-warm duvet for cold sleepers, for people who live in areas with colder climates. Lightweight to sleep under and keeps you warm without adding extra weight and bulk. 【Exquisite Craftsmanship】- 3D Baffle Box Construction with superior stitching keeps the light down evenly distributed, no shifting or clumping. The filling can truly expand and creates maximum loft, make the comforter cloud like fluffy and eliminate cold spots, brings extreme warmth and comfort on cold days. - Nice piping and double needle stitching avoid shedding and enhance durability. Corner tabs help secure the comforter in place, prevent from shifting. 【Care Instruction】- Dry Cleaning. Clean your comforter as infrequently as possible, as this can also damage the down filling. Spot cleaning stains is also a great way to extend the time between washings. Since the down comforter is vacuum packed, it is recommended to spread it for a few hours and pat or shake gently by holding each end to fully expand. This increases airflow and helps stop the clumping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZO9oDm5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B08F27S2CN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F27S2CN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F27S2CN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
