window.products.push({"id":1084949,"name":"Striped Throw Blanket - Farmhouse Style Throws with Cabana Stripe Coastal Beach Pattern - Soft Light Woven Blankets with Stripes for Sofa, Bed, Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91F06fvaIHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These contemporary, lightweight striped throw blankets are a perfect addition to your living room or bedroom decor. An all-season throw, this blanket makes it easy to style your outdoor adventures - picnics, concerts, campfires, summer and fall events, or just relaxing on the patio, at beach house or by the pool - wherever you may need something cozy and comfortable. This throw blanket is small enough to fit in a backpack or purse and also travels well!The nautical-themed blanket with stripes features a traditional, coastal-inspired cabana stripe pattern with decorative fringe edges and makes a great indoor design accent for a couch, bed, blanket ladder, or other living spaces. These stripe throws measure 50 x 60 in. and come in a variety of vibrant and neutral colors including white with warm gray, cream, sky blue, sea foam, light pink, and more. While great throws for sofas and chairs, this stripe blanket can also even be worn as an everyday shawl or shoulder wrap on a cool beach day!Woven of skin-friendly, soft acrylic, and conveniently machine-washable (for long life only wash when needed). Colorfast dies are resistant to fading. You will love this casual striped blanket and amazed by its quality and value. These blankets come in gift-ready packaging and are a great gift idea for almost any occasion: housewarming, thank you, get well, baby showers, Christmas and holidays, and much more!BENEFITS of Acrylic Fiber- Holds vibrant colors even after washing- Soft woven fabric drapes well- Durable, long-lasting- Machine washable and quick-dryingCARE Instructions- Machine wash cold- No bleach or dry cleaning- Tumble dry low- Cool iron if neededStriped blankets and throws, especially in the old Turkish-inspired, cabana stripe throw blanket pattern, are extremely versatile accent pieces for a wide variety of home decors.Good Manors Living - Respect for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91F06fvaIHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Manors Living","source_asin":"B09Q5BW1FH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q5BW1FH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q5BW1FH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
