window.products.push({"id":1084960,"name":"Thirteen Chefs 3 Piece Professional Grade Cutting Board Set, Non Slip Grips, BPA Free and NSF Certified","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ytPyxK3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Universal 3 Piece Cutting Board Set by Thirteen Chefs Equip your kitchen with the last set of cutting boards you'll ever need! Set comes with a large 16x10 inch cutting board that is great for preparing salads and cutting meats. The medium 12x8 board is an all-around board that is convenient for everyday tasks such as cutting vegetables and fruits. The small 10x6 board is our favorite, as it is incredibly convenient for quick jobs from slicing apples to cutting sandwiches in half. Large or small, each cutting boards include a juice groove on the top side of the board that helps prevent messes and spills when cutting fruits or meats thanks to the outside channel that traps liquids. For jobs that don't need the groove, simply use the flat bottom of the cutting board for a full size cutting surface! Designed by chefs for chefs, we know there's nothing more frustrating than cutting on a cutting board that slips and slides. That's why we developed our cutting board with four full length rubber strips that cover both sides of the board. We also used a textured and soft rubber that makes our cutting board truly non slip compared to anything on the market. Thirteen Chefs is an American company that stands behind our products. This 3-piece set is backed with a 3 year guarantee against defects, so you never need to worry about warping, cracked or poor quality cutting boards. Made from polypropylene, our boards are also dishwasher safe and easily sanitized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ytPyxK3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thirteen Chefs","source_asin":"B08DLBVS6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DLBVS6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DLBVS6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1084961,"name":"Mini-Bar Hollow Book with Flask & Shot Glasses - Grimm's Complete Fairy Tales (Leather-bound) (Magnetic Closure)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916Gwd9rcUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This leather-bound book has been hollowed out to precisely fit an 8.5 ounce Italian-made pocket flask and (2) two-ounce shot glasses (included). Pull ribbons enable easy shot glass extraction while a strong magnetic closure keeps everything in place. Add custom etching to the flask to make the perfect gift! - Hand cut from a real leather-bound book - Book features an exquisite leather binding, distinctive gilt edging, and a silk-ribbon bookmark - A strong magnetic closure prevents the glassware from accidentally coming out - Italian-made pocket flask features a seal tight swing top, which creates a hermetic leak-proof seal - Hollow book constructed entirely with archival-quality adhesives - Appears like a normal book with natural page edges when closed (no glue on outside) - Book dimensions: 9.40 x 6.50 x 1.88 inches _______________________________________ Glass Etching: Have your own text etched on the pocket flask (optional). We use the superior sandblasting method which produces a rich, deep etching. Glass etching is permanent and will not wash, chip, or wear off. Makes a great gift! Choose from ten designs. See listing images for the designs. Please enter your design number and text to be etched on the flask before adding to your cart. If you do not want the flask etched (keeping the flask blank), please leave the customization box blank. Opting to have the flask etched will incur an additional fee. *Flask ships empty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916Gwd9rcUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BookRooks","source_asin":"B019AZGCVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019AZGCVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019AZGCVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1084962,"name":"Crystal Kiddush Cup and Saucer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AcoauVXTL._AC_.jpg","description":"This beautiful and expressive crystal Kiddush Cup and Saucer feature a grapevine. The cup itself is from fine crystal and has a beautiful design of grapes with a trim band near the top. The distinctive feature of this Kiddush cup is the grape leaves and the opaque almost opal-like grapes which grace the side of the cup. The saucer complements the Kiddush cup nicely as it is also from crystal and has a beautiful design of grapes with a trim band near the side. Capacity - Cup: holds 6oz and 3.9”H x 2.625” saucer: 5.25”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AcoauVXTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Studio Silversmith","source_asin":"B00EP5PPWO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1084962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EP5PPWO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EP5PPWO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
